null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Section 1. Statutory Pay Systems. Pursuant to the Continuing Appropriations\nand Surface Transportation Extensions Act, 2011 (H.R. 3082), which I signed\ninto law today (the ‘‘Continuing Appropriations Act ’’), the rates of basic\npay or salaries of the statutory pay systems (as defined in 5 U.S.C. 5302(1))\nare set forth on the schedules attached hereto and made a part hereof:","original_source":{"page_or_item":"75 FR 81817 (PDF p. 1); Sec. 1 (lead-in)","sha256":"4c96597eadb7d0a7fa102bcc65aa20ff4b16ac4c67f544ace4fad4339df73b1b","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2010-12-29/pdf/2010-32960.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13561#sec1","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a) The General Schedule (5 U.S.C. 5332(a)) at Schedule 1;","original_source":{"page_or_item":"75 FR 81817 (PDF p. 1); Sec. 1(a)","sha256":"4c96597eadb7d0a7fa102bcc65aa20ff4b16ac4c67f544ace4fad4339df73b1b","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2010-12-29/pdf/2010-32960.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13561#sec1(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) The Foreign Service Schedule (22 U.S.C. 3963) at Schedule 2; and","original_source":{"page_or_item":"75 FR 81817 (PDF p. 1); Sec. 1(b)","sha256":"4c96597eadb7d0a7fa102bcc65aa20ff4b16ac4c67f544ace4fad4339df73b1b","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2010-12-29/pdf/2010-32960.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13561#sec1(b)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(c) The schedules for the Veterans Health Administration of the Department\nof Veterans Affairs (38 U.S.C. 7306, 7404; section 301(a) of Public Law\n102–40) at Schedule 3.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"75 FR 81817 (PDF p. 1); Sec. 1(c)","sha256":"4c96597eadb7d0a7fa102bcc65aa20ff4b16ac4c67f544ace4fad4339df73b1b","url":"https://ww